     {
      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Frolic is a play circuit without a tower. Hexagonal net platforms, net climbers, wooden stepping beams, stepping posts and a trail of stepping pods form a balance course children can run in a loop. It suits active groups and works well beside a taller structure that already has slides. Frolic takes 30 to 35 children. The product area is 18' x 16'8\" and the safe play area is 24' x 22'8\". Balancing along the trail builds confidence, strength, leadership and self control. Frolic is finished in mixed colours. The 3-year warranty covers the pipes, moulded parts, laminates and play rope. Tell us what else is planned on your site and we will design around it."
     }
    ]
